uring London Olympics","category":"historical_event"},{"event":"Prince 21 Nights in London residency","date":"2007","description":"Record-breaking residency that helped establish the venue's reputation","category":"performance"}]	[{"feature":"Dome Structure","description":"Iconic white tensile fabric roof spanning 365m in diameter, supported by twelve 100m yellow towers","category":"architecture"},{"feature":"Advanced Acoustics","description":"Purpose-built sound system and acoustic treatment designed specifically for live music","category":"acoustics"},{"feature":"Entertainment District","description":"Located within larger entertainment complex including restaurants, cinema, and exhibition space","category":"amenities"}]	f	\N
