ark complex with roller coasters visible during performances","category":"location"},{"feature":"Covered grandstand","description":"Historic covered seating area provides protection from elements while maintaining outdoor atmosphere","category":"architecture"},{"feature":"Flexible configuration","description":"Can be set up for various types of events with both field seating and lawn areas","category":"stage"}]	f	\N
